<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 27 June <span class="n">9</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/conan-i-of-brittany"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Conan I of Brittany</span><span class="tp">d. 992</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/sancho-vi-of-navarre"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/sancho-vi-of-navarre.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Sancho VI of Navarre</span><span class="tp">1132–1194</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/floris-v-count-of-holland"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/floris-v-count-of-holland.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Floris V, Count of Holland</span><span class="tp">1254–1296</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/giorgio-vasari"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/giorgio-vasari.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Giorgio Vasari</span><span class="tp">1511–1574</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/date-masamune"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/date-masamune.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Date Masamune</span><span class="tp">1567–1636</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/wenzel-anton-von-kaunitz-rietberg"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/wenzel-anton-von-kaunitz-rietberg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Wenzel Anton von Kaunitz-Rietberg</span><span class="tp">1711–1794</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/grand-duke-konstantin-pavlovich-of-russia"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/grand-duke-konstantin-pavlovich-of-russia.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Grand Duke Konstantin Pavlovich of Russia</span><span class="tp">1779–1831</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ranjit-singh"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ranjit-singh.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ranjit Singh</span><span class="tp">1780–1839</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/georgios-papadopoulos"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/georgios-papadopoulos.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Georgios Papadopoulos</span><span class="tp">1919–1999</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
